<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- Doondo</book>
  <para style="h">2 KOLINTO</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Ko</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Kolinto</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda wunzole wu Pawuli ku bisi-Kolinto</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda wunzole wu Pawuli ku bisi-</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kolinto</para>
  <para style="imt">Nkotolo</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu ni mukanda wuhiika wusonika Pawuli ku minkwikidi mii ku mbanza Kolinto. Mu mukanda andi wutekila wubateela ti wuu na nsatu mu kwe babumina. Wubateela mpe bayonzika minkayulu, mwanki batambika myo ku minkwikidi mii ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi, mpe yandi bende waakwenda bonga myo. Kansi kayenda ko. Musamu wu kalembolo kwendila ni ewu: Timote bu kedi kwenda ku mbanza Kolinto, mu nzila bamuteela bwedi bubeela ndyatulu yi minkwikidi mii koko. Ndyatulu yiba yimbote ko. Bamuteela ti mwa ndambu yi bantu yi Bayudayo yiyenda ku mbanza Kolinto na yilonga misamu miba miswaswana na Musamu Wumbote wu teka longa Pawuli koko. Bantu bebobo bateela dyaka ku minkwikidi mi Kolinto ti Pawuli kaa ntumwa yikedika yi Klisto ko. Wuvutuka na wuteela wo ku Pawuli. Pawuli wuyena kyadi kikingi. Ni hahoho kabongila nzengolo ye basonikina mu bateela misamu miba nandi ku nsye mutima, na nkye musamu wusa ti kalembolo kwenda mu babumina.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pawuli wuta mu mukanda bewowo ti yandi ntumwa yi Klisto kadi, kansi nsadulu andi yiswasana yidi na yi bahiika bakwe longanga nzila kuu bantu. Musamu wawowo wusa ti bamubela. Wuba mpe wunyonga, ni kata ti, tiidi mu ba kintwadi na bisi-Kolinto. Wubwesa bateela dyaka ti batatamana mu yonzika minkayulu mwanki basadisa minkwikidi mii ku mbanza Yelusalemi. Wubwesa ta dyaka ti, wakidi na nsatu mu kwe babumina, mwanki kalenda mu ta kikedika ku yobobo balembolo biika masumu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tala ti Pawuli wutelama nakekete bu kata ti ntumwa kadi, mu dyambu wutya ti, bantu bazaba Mambu Mambote, mpe bazaba ti Yesu Mfumu kadi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndandani yi mukanda bewuwu ebu yidi:</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Zimbote na mvutudulu yi matondo ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 1:1-11">1.1-11</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Kisalu ki ntumwa ku minkwikidi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 1:12-2:17">1.12–2.17</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Kutya muntu bonso bututila Klisto (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 3:1-7:16">3.1–7.16</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Lusadusu ku bamputu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 8:1-9:15">8.1–9.15</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">5) Pawuli ntumwa yikedika kadi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 10:1-13:10">10.1–13.10</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">6) Mbote zi manunu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 13:11-13">13.11-13</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="s1">Zimbote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Meno ni Pawuli, Nzambi wu katumisa mu luzolo lwandi, mu ba ntumwa yi Klisto Yesu na mpangi eto Timote, nilusonikini yeno dibundu di Nzambi dii ku mbanza yi Kolinto na bantu bamvimba bavwihulu ku Nzambi baa mu kizunga kimvimba ki Akayi: <verse eid="2CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Bika Nzambi Tata dyeto na Mfumu eto Yesu Klisto kalusakumuna na kaluhaana kiyenge!<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawuli wuzitisa Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Nzitusu ku Nzambi, Yandi wudi Tata di Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto, Tata difulukidi mu nkenda na Nzambi yikwe syamisanga bantu ntangu zimvimba! <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />Wukwe tusyamisanga mu mpasi zeto zimvimba, mwanki yeto mpe tusyamisa yobobo baa mu mpasi zi mumpila-mumpila mu nsyamusu yi tukwe tambulanga yeto bende ku Nzambi . <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Bonso bu tuna yenina mpasi zizingi mu kintwadi kyeto na Klisto, ni bwabobo mpe tuna syamusu bubwingi mu Klisto. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Ni mu dyambu dye lusyamisa na mu lutabila, tuna kwe yenini mpasi. Tala ti tusyamusu, mwanki lubaka mbombolo, yaaluhaana ngolo mu vibidila mpasi zimosi na zo zi tuna vibidila yeto mpe. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Ni hahoho, kivuvu kyeto mu yeno kisyama kidi, tuzebi ti bu ludi kintwadi mu mpasi zeto, yeno mpe ludi kintwadi mu nsyamusu eto.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Mpangi zeto, tutiidi luzaba mfyetokoso zizingi zi tuyena ku kizunga ki Aziya. Mfyetokoso bezozo zihyoka kitezo na ngolo zeto. Zizimbisa kivuvu kyeto na tubanza ti twaabwesa ba bamoyo ko. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Kansi ku nsye mitima myeto, tuyena ti tufwidi na tusa dyaka kivuvu mu yeto bende ko, kansi mu Nzambi kwe fulukisanga bafwa. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Yandi wutukuula mu lufwa lubobo, waatukuula dyaka. Ninga, tudi na kivuvu mu yandi ti waatukuula dyaka mu lufwa. <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />Yeno mpe lutusadisa mu zinsambulu zeno. Bwabobo, Nzambi kaavutudila mvutu mu zinsambulu zi bantu babingi mu dyambu dyeto, waatuhidikila mambote, mwanki bantu babingi baavutudila Nzambi matondo mu dyambu dyeto.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Vema na Makani ma Pawuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Musamu wumosi wuna tuyangidika, ni ndinga yina kwe te kimbangi ku nsye mitima myeto ti tudyata mu nza, sungula ha ntadisi eno, tudyatila mu makedika na mu ludedomo lukwe fumanga ku Nzambi. Ka tutwadusulu mu ndwenga zi kimuntu ko, kansi mu mulemvo wu Nzambi. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Mu mikanda myeto tuna lusonikina misamu mihiika ko, kansi ni myo mi lukwe tanganga momo na mi lutekidi zaba. Mpe nii na kivuvu ti lwaabakula myo bonso bufwanakani, <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />mu dyambu ti lubakudi ndambu. Lulendi kiyangidika mu dyambu dyeto, bumosi yeto mpe tulendi kiyangidika mu dyambu dyeno, mu kilumbu kyaakwiza Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Ni mu kivuvu bekyokyo natya ti niza ntete ku yeno, mwanki lubaka lusakumunu nkumbu yinzole, <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />bu naahyokila ku yeno mu kwenda ku kizunga Masedwani, mboki bu nafuma ku Masedwani, mbo nahyokila dyaka ku yeno, mpe na kivuvu kye baka lusadusu ku yeno, mu nzyetolo ani ku kizunga ki Yuda. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Bu nabaka mayindu bemomo, nganunu naba wuzitama ko e? Hoti nzengolo zani, ziba kwandi zi kimuntu, mwanki meno nata ha kimosi ti «ninga» mpe «kaani» e? <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Nzambi wukwikama kadi na wudi mbangi ani: misamu mi nina luteela mii ha kimosi ko «ninga» mpe «kaani». <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Mu dyambu ti Yesu-Klisto, Mwana Nzambi, meno bende, Sila na Timote wutulusamunina, kaba ha kimosi ko «ninga» mpe «kaani». Kansi mu yandi «ninga» kaka ntangu zimvimba. <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Mu dyambu ti, zinsilulu zimvimba zi Nzambi, mu yandi muu «ninga», mpe mu yandi tukwe telanga ti «ameni» mu kembisa Nzambi. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Nzambi yandi bende wuna tusyamisa ha kimosi neeno mu kintwadi kyeto na Klisto. Yandi mpe wutusoodidi mu kisalu kyandi, <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />Yandi mpe wututuula kinyemo kyandi mu lonka ti yandi wutuvwidi na wutuula mu mitima myeto Mpeve Yilongo bonso kikunku ki kateekisa mu bimwama bi kaatuhaana.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Mu meno, nina bongila Nzambi bonso mbangi yi kizingu kyani, navutukila ku mbanza yi Kolinto ko, mwanki lulembolo yena mpasi. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Yeto tuna sosa mu lutuma misamu mi luna kwikila ko, mu dyambu ti luu kweno bakwikama mu kiminu, kansi tutiidi kwandi mu luhaana kyese kihyokidi.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Ni hahoho, nabongidi nzengolo meno bende mu lembolo vutuka ku yeno, mwanki lulembolo yena dyaka kyadi. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Tala ti nina luyenisa kyadi, buna nani waanyenisa dyaka kyese e? Tala ti ka ni yeno kaka ko ba naayenisi kyadi e? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Ni hahoho, nalusonikini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu mukanda wu tulembolo yena mukanda wu tatu ku bisi-Kolinto, mukanda wunzole ku bisi-Kolinto wudi mukanda wu biya. Mayindu ma bahiika madi ti mukanda Pawuli wu kana sila mayindu wulendi ba mukanda wuntete wu Kolinto, wulendi ba mpe wunzole wu Kolinto, wulendi ba dyaka mukanda wuntatu wu kasonika ku mabundu.</char></note> bonso bu nasidi, mwanki bu nina kwiza tula, bantu baketi nyenisa kyese balembolo nyenisa kyadi. Bwabu nsiidi kiminu ti kyese kyani kidi mpe kyese ki yeno bamvimba. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Nina lusonikina mu manyongo na kyadi kikingi mu mutima, mpe na manswela mu meso. Ka mu luyenisa kyadi ko, kansi mwanki luzaba bwedi nalutiidi bubwingi.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulemvokila muntu wutusidi bubi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Tala ti muntu wumosi ha kati dyeno wuyenisi munandi kyadi, ka mu dyambu dyani ko kayenini kyadi, kansi mu dyambu di yeno bamvimba, hoti mwa ndambu ha kati dyeno, mu lembolo hyokisa kitezo. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Muntu wu bobobo wufwanakani ba mubamina ku bantu babingi ha kati dyeno. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Kansi bwabu lufweti mulemvokila, na mu musyamisa, mwanki kalembolo kota mu kyadi kikingi kilendi mu zimbisa. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Ni hahoho, nina lulomba lumulonka ti lumutiidi bubwingi, <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />mu dyambu ti nalusonikina dyaka ebu: ntiidi mu lutonta mu tala ti lukwe vuminanga ntumunu. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Bu lwalemvokila muntu, meno mpe nina mulemvokila. Tala ti nalemvokidi muntu, hoti nkatika dyambu di hoho dye mulemvokila, mu dyambu dyeno nasididi bobo ha ntadisi yi Klisto, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />mwanki tulembolo bika Satana katuyaala, mu dyambu ti makani mandi matuzebi.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawuli ku mbanza Tolowasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Bu natula ku mbanza Towasi mu samuna Musamu wumbote wu Klisto, mpeleko Mfumu wunzibudila mwelo, <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />kansi mayindu mani maba mazuna ko, mu dyambu ti nayenda bata mpangi ani Tito ko. Ni hahoho nasala basisila mbote ni nayenda ku kizunga ki Masedwani.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nungunu mu Yesu-Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Matondo ku Nzambi kwe tatamananga mu tunungisa mu Klisto na kwe tusadilanga mu mwangisa mu bibuka bimvimba nzayilu andi bonso mananasi ma mfuku yimbote. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Mu dyambu ti, mu Nzambi tudi bonso mananasi ma mfuku yimbote ma Klisto ha kati di yobobo bavulusu, na ha kati di yobobo bana zimbala: <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Ku bantu eba mfuku yi lufwa yikwe natanga ku lufwa, mpe ku bantu bahiika mfuku yi luzingu yikwe natanga ku luzingu. Buna nani kwandi wudi wulunga mu kisalu kibubu e? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Mu dyambu ti, tuu bonso bantu bahiika ko, bakwe kitulanga Mambu ma Nzambi mumbungu. Kansi yeto Nzambi wutufidisa na tukwe zonzanga mu makedika mu nkumbu Nzambi ha ntadisi andi mu kintwadi na Klisto.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Luwawanu lumoona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Bwedi, tuna sosila dyaka mu kitambika yeto bende e? Hoti tuu na nsatu, bonso bantu bahiika, yi mikanda mina bahaana luve mu batambula, hoti tululomba mikanda mina tuhaana luve mu lutambula e? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Yebende ludi mukanda weto wu basonikini mu mitima myeto, mpe bantu bamvimba balendi zaba na kutanga wo. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Wukedika ti, yeno mukanda wusonika Klisto ludi, mu kisalu kyeto. Mu sonika mukanda bewowo, kasadila ntinta ko, kansi wusadila Mpeve yi Nzambi yimoyo, mpe kasonika mu matadi ko, kansi mu mitima myeno.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Tuzonzila bobo mu dyambu di kivuvu kii neto mu Nzambi mu Klisto. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Ka mu ngolo zi yeto bende ko tulendi sadila kisalu ki bobo. Kansi ngolo zeto zikwe fumanga ku Nzambi, <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />ni Nzambi wu tuheeni ngolo mu ba bisadi bi luwawanu lumoona, tudi ku nsye lutumu lu Misiku misonama ko, kansi lu Mpeve yi Nzambi. Mu dyambu ti Misiku mikwe natanga ku lufwa, kansi Mpeve yi Nzambi yikwe haananga luzingu.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Misiku miba misonama ha yulu matadi na Mose wuba kisadi ki Misiku bemyomyo mikwe natanga ku lufwa. Mpeleko bobobo bubela, kansi kisalu bekyokyo kyedi muhaananga nkembo yiyinene. Mu dyambu di nkembo yedi lezima mu kizizi kyandi, ba-Isaeli balembakana mu musungimina. Mpe kulezima bekoko kwedi zingilanga ko, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />bwedi bwabu kisalu ki Mpeve yi Nzambi kyaalembolo beela na nkembo yihyokidi e? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Tala ti kisalu ki Misiku kikwe twadilanga bantu nsembolo kinata nkembo, bwedi kisalu ki lunungu kyaalembolo vudila nkembo e? <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Mu dyambu ti, nkembo wulezima mu ntama wuzimbisa kulezima kwandi ha ntadisi yi nkembo wumoona wu bubedidi wutomini hyokila kitezo. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Tala ti kyokyokyo kilembolo zingila kiba na nkembo, bwedi bwabu kyokyokyo kyaatatamana kyaalembolo lutila nkembo e?<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Butudi na kivuvu kibobobo, tuna toma lonkisa kibakala kyeto kikingi. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Tusandi bonso Mose wufuka kiini kyandi mu kitambala, mwanki ba-Isaeli balembolo sungimina bwedi bwaazimbidila nkembo yalembolo zingila. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Kansi babisa kwawu mu bakula. Mu dyambu ti natee mu kilumbu bekiki, bu bakwe tanganga Luwawanu Luntama, kitambala bekyokyo kyakidi na kilendi katuka ko. Kadi ni mu Klisto kaka kilendi zimbidila. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Natee mu kilumbu ki bubedidi, ntangu zimvimba zi bakwe tanganga mabuuku masonika Mose, kitambala kikwe kanganga mitima myawu. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Kansi, bonso bu wudi wusonama ti: «Tala ti muntu viludi madyela mu sadila Mfumu, kitambala kikatukidi.» <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Mu dyambu ti Mfumu wudi Mpeve, mpe ho ha kwe banga Mpeve yi Mfumu, hahoho ha kimpwanza. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Yeto bamvimba tudi na kiini kilembolo fuku kitambala, tuna kiyenikisa bonso mu kitala-tala, nkembo yi Mfumu, tukitukidi mu kifwani bekyokyo, mu nkembo ha yulu nkembo yihyokidi dyaka kitezo. Kyokyo ni kisalu ki Mfumu wudi Mpeve.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s1">Mpasi mu kintwadi na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Nzambi wutuhaana kisalu bekiki mu nkenda zandi, ni hahoho, yeto tulendi lebakana ko. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Yeto tubisa misamu minsoni hoti mi mansweki, tukwe sadilanga luvunu ko, na tukwe sanzanga Mambu ma Nzambi ko. Kansi, bu tukwe zabikisanga kikedika ha meso ma bantu, ni bwabobo, tukwe haaninanga nzila ku kadi muntu katala ndyatulu eto ha ntadisi yi Nzambi. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Tala ti Musamu Wumbote wu tukwe samunanga, wufuku wudi ku nsye kitambala, buna wudi wufuku ku bantu bazimbala, <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />bakwe lembolo kwikilanga mu dyambu ti, Satana, nzambi yi nza beyiyi, wufuka madyela mawu. Kwe bakakidilanga mu yena kya kukwe haananga Musamu Wumbote wu nkembo yi Klisto, wudi kifwani ki Nzambi. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Mu dyambu ti mu ndongosolo eto, ka yeto bende ko tuna kwe samuni, kansi ni Yesu-Klisto wudi Mfumu, mpe tweka bisadi byeno mu dyambu di Yesu. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Mu dyambu ti, Nzambi beyoyo yita ti: «Kya kwaalezima ha kati di kitombe!» Yandi mpe wusa ti kya kwandi kulezima mu mitima myeto, mwanki katuhaana nzayulu yi nkembo yi Nzambi yina lezima mu kiini ki Klisto.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Kansi tuna kwe nati kimvwama bekyokyo ki kimpeve mu kati dyeto, bonso bisiku bi tubumba, mwanki buyenika ha meso ma bantu ti, lulendo belolo lungitukulu lufuma ku Nzambi, kansi ka ku yeto ko. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Bana tukwamisa mu ndambu ka ndambu, kansi bana tubedisa ko. Tuu na mayindu yeku-yeku, kansi tuzimbisi kivuvu ko. <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />Bana tufyetikisa, kansi Nzambi kana tunyafuna ko. Bana tulosa ha nsi, kansi tuna zimbala ko. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Tuna tatamana mu kwe nati mu nitu eto lufwa lu Yesu, mwanki luzingu lwandi luyenika mpe mu nitu eto. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Mu dyambu ti bamoyo tudi, kansi ntangu zimvimba tuna yekolo ku lufwa mu dyambu di Yesu, mwanki luzingu lu Yesu luyenika mpe mu nitu eto yikwe fwanga. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Ni hahoho, lufwa luna sala mu yeto, mwanki luzingu lusala mu yeno.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Masonama mana ta ti: «Nakwikidi, ni hahoho nazonzidi.» Yeto mpe mu Mpeve yimosi yi kiminu, tuna kwikila, na ni hahoho tuna zonzila. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Tutomini zaba ti Nzambi wufulukisa Mfumu Yesu mu bafwa, waatufulukisa yeto mpe mu bafwa mu kintwadi na Yesu, na waatuyenikisa ha kimosi neeno ha ntadisi andi. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Mu dyambu di bumbote bweno misamu mimvimba bemimi mitutudidi, mwanki mulemvo bu wuna funana, bantu babingi bavutula matondo, mu nkembo wu Nzambi.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kivuvu kii ku yulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Ni hahoho tuna lembolo lebakana. Kati ti nitu eto yi nsuni yina kwe bebi, mpeve yina kwe kituki yimoona kadi kilumbu. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Mpasi zi tuna yena zina hyoka na zifyoti kwandi zidi, kansi zina tubutila nkembo wuwunene, wumimvu ka mimvu, wuhyokidi kitezo. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Mu dyambu ti, tuna tala bima bikwe yenikanga ko, kansi byo bikwe lembolo yenikanga. Bima bikwe yenikanga, bikwe zingilanga ko, kansi byo bikwe lembolo yenikanga bikwe zingilanga mimvu ka mimvu.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Tutomini zaba ti, nzo eto yii ha butoto yi kikapu yidi. Tala ti yimwangani, tufweti zaba ti Nzambi wutukubikila ku mazulu, nzo yi balembolo tunga mu moko ma bantu, yaazingila mimvu ka mimvu. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Mpe tuna kunga bwabu, mu dyambu ti tuu na nsatu yiyingi mu lwata nzo eto yii ku mazulu. <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />Tala ti tumeni lwata nitu beyoyo, Nzambi kaatuyena dyaka mpene ko. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Mu dyambu ti, yeto tudi mu nzo beyiyi yi kikapu, tuna kunga, tuna kwamusu, ka mu dyambu ti tutiidi mu katula binkutu ko, kansi tutiidi mu lwata byo, mwanki luzingu kamina byo bikwe fwanga. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Ni Nzambi Yandi bende wutukubikidi mu luzingu belulu, wutuhaana Mpeve Yilongo, ni kikunku kintete mu bimvwama bi katukubikila.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Ni hahoho, tudi na kibakala kikingi ntangu zimvimba! Tuzebi ti bu twakidi mu nitu beyiyi, tudi ku nsi yi bunzenza, mpe kitatu na Mfumu. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Mu dyambu ti, tuna kwe dyatidi mu mona meso ko, kansi mu kiminu. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Ntangu zimvimba tudi balwatu mu kibakala kikingi, mpe tutiidi mu sisa nitu beyiyi mu kwe zinga kintwadi na Mfumu. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Ni hahoho, ni tuzinga mu nitu beyiyi hoti ni tusisa yo, dyambu divudi mfunu ni mu yangidika Mfumu. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Mu dyambu ti bamvimba tuna ba ha ntadisi yi Klisto mwanki katufundisa, mpe kadi muntu kaatambula mufutu mu myo mi kasadidi mimbote hoti mimbi.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kisalu kye wawisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Ni hahoho, yeto tuzebi bwedi bwe vuminina Mfumu na tuna sosa bwabu mu sa ti bantu bakwikila. Nzambi yandi bende wutuzebi, mpe nii na kivuvu ti mu mabanza meeno, yeno mpe lutuzebi. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Yeto tuna kilonka dyaka yeto bende kuu yeno ko, kansi tutiidi mu luhaana hwahwa dye kiyangidika mu dyambu dyeto, mwanki lulenda mu vutula mvutu ku bantu bana kiyangidika mu myo mikwe yenikanga, kansi ka mu myo mii ku nsye mutima ko. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Tala ti tubedi bilahuki, ni mu dyambu di Nzambi, tala ti tudi bantu ba mayindu ma sikama, ni mu dyambu dyeno. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Mu dyambu ti, luzolo lu Klisto lutulweti yeto, yeto tudi na kiminu ti wumosi kwandi wufwa mu dyambu di bantu bamvimba, mwanki bamvimba bafwa kintwadi nandi. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Tala ti wufwa mu dyambu di bantu bamvimba, mwanki bantu bana zinga balembolo bwesa zinga mu dyambu di yawu bende, kansi mu dyambu di Yondowo wufwa na wufuluka mu bafwa mu dyambu dyawu.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Ni hahoho, tuna bongila dyaka muntu mu nsuni ko. Kati mu ntangu yi ntama tubongila Klisto mu nsuni, kansi bwabu tuna bwesa mu bongila bo ko. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Ni hahoho, tala ti muntu wudi mu Klisto, yandi weka muntu wumoona, misamu mi nkulu mihyoka, misamu mimoona mihingani. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Mpe, mimvimba bemyomyo mikwe fumanga ku Nzambi wutuwawisa nandi mu Klisto, mpe wutuhaana kiyeko kye wawisa bahiika na Nzambi. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Mu dyambu ti, mu Klisto, Nzambi wusala mu wawisa nza na Yandi bende, wulembolo tala masumu ma bantu. Mpe wutusoola mu samuna kisalu ki nyuwasani.<verse eid="2CO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Yeto tudi bimonikisi bitambika Klisto, bonso ti Nzambi mu nzila eto wuna tumisa bantu. Tulubombididi mu nkumbu yi Yesu, bika luwawasana na Nzambi! <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Mu dyambu ti, Klisto kasumuka ko, kansi Nzambi wumutwika masumu meto, mwanki mu kintwadi nandi, batusa bantu balunungu ha ntadisi yi Nzambi.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Ni hahoho, bu tuna sala kintwadi na Nzambi, tuna lusyamisa mu lembolo nyafuna mulemvo wu lutambula ku Nzambi ko. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Mu dyambu ti Nzambi wuta ebu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">«Mu ntangu yifwanakani, meno nakuyuwila,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">mpe kilumbu ki mpulusu, meno nakusadisa.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesaya 49.8</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">Kadi bwabu yiyiyi nkatika ni ntangu yifwanakani. Kikiki ni kilumbu ki mpulusu!<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bisadi bi Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Yeto tukwe tesisanga muntu sakuba ko, mwanki balembolo vweza kisalu kyeto. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Kansi, mu misamu mimvimba, tuna sosa mu nzila zimvimba mu kilonka bonso bisadi bi Nzambi: tukwe tatamananga mu vibidila mpasi, mu mulembolo ba na kima na mu nkwamusu. <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />Batuzuba bikoti na batutuula mu boloko, mukangu wutunangumukina, tusala bisalu bingolo, tumina nsoki na tubwa tolo ko. <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />Tuna kilonka bisadi bi Nzambi mu mvedosolo, mu nzayilu yi Nzambi, mu mvibudulu, mu bumbote, mu Mpeve Yilongo na mu luzolo lukedika, <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />mu Mambu ma kikedika, mu lulendo lu Nzambi, mu binwanunu byeto bye nwanina na bye kikakidila ni mu sa lunungu ha ntadisi yi Nzambi, <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />ni kuba mu kati di nkembo hoti mu mvwezolo, mu mwangusunu yi nsangu zimbi hoti zimbote. Bana tubongila bonso bantu baluvunu, mpeleko tuna ta makedika, <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />bonso bantu balembolo zabakana, mpeleko batoma zabakana tudi, bonso bantu bafwa, mpeleko nkatika bamoyo tudi. Bana tuyenina bonso bantu ba bana semba, mpeleko bana tuhonda ko, <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />bana tuyenina bonso bantu baa mu kyadi, mpeleko ntangu zimvimba tudi bakiyangidika, bonso bantu bamputu, mpeleko babingi tuna vwamisa, bonso bantu balembolo ba na kima, mpeleko bimvimba bii neeto.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Yeno bisi-Kolinto, tuluzonzidi wulembolo sweka musamu, mpe tutomini luzibudila mitima myeto. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Yeto tulukangidi mitima ko, kansi yeno lutukangidi mitima. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Bwabu nina luzonzila bonso baala bani: yeno mpe, tomeeno tuzibudila mitima myeno!<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lunungu na mambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CO 6:14">2 Ko 6.14</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 7:1">7.1</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 10:14-22">1 Ko 10.14-22</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:5-11">Efe 5.5-11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:4">Nza 18.4</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9-12">1 Pet 2.9-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Lubandi kintwadi na bantu bakwe lembolo kwikilanga mu Nzambi ko. Mu dyambu ti, nkye nyuwasani yidi ha kati di lunungu na mambi e? Hoti nkye kintwadi kidi ha kati di kya na kitombe e? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Nganunu Klisto lendi yuwasana na Satana e? Nkye kintwadi kilendi ba ha kati di munkwikidi na muntu wukwe lembolo kwikilanga mu Nzambi e? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Nkye nyuwasani yilendi ba ha kati di nzo-Nzambi na nsambudulu yi biteki e? Mu dyambu ti, yeto tudi nzo yi Nzambi yimoyo, bonso Yandi bende Nzambi bu kata ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">«Naazinga ha kati dyawu, mpe naadyata nawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">naaba Nzambi awu na yawu baaba mukangu ani.»<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Ni hahoho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">«duukeeno ha kati dyawu, mpe batatukileeno, Mfumu teedi bobo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">Lusimbandi kima kilembolo ba kivedila ko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">mpe meno naalutambula.<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />Naaba Tata ku yeno</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">na yeno lwaaba baala babakento na babakala ku meno,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">Mfumu yilulendo lumvimba teedi bobo.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kapu 16 à 18: Kibuku. 16: <char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 26:12">KdL 26.12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:27">Yez 37.27</ref></char>. –Kibuku. 17: Lulendi tanga mpe mu <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 52:11">Yes 52.11</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:34">Yez 20.34</ref></char>. –Kibuku. 18: Lulendi tanga mpe mu <char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">2 Sam 7.14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:6">Yes 43.6</ref></char>. </char></note><verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Mpangi zani zizola, mu dyambu ti nsilulu zi bobobo zii neto, tukivediseeno mu mimvimba milendi safula nitu eto na mpeve eto, mpe tutatamaneeno mu bulongo natee ku nsukunu, mu bunkuta bu Nzambi.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kyese ki Pawuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Tuzibudileeno mi mitima myeno! Yeto tuhidikidi misamu mimbi ku muntu ko, tumanisi bimvwama bi muntu ko, tulebidi bima bi muntu ko. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Ka mu dyambu dye lufundisa ko nina zonzila bobo, mu dyambu ti wana teka luteela: yeno ludi mu mitima myeto mu lufwa na mu luzingu. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Kivuvu kikingi kii naani mu yeno, mpe nina toma kiyangidika mu yeno. Wutoma syamusu nidi na kyese kyani kina sampa mu mpasi zeto zimvimba.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Mu dyambu ti, twabeki ntangu ye huma ko buna bu tutudidi ku kizunga ki Masedwani. Kansi tuyena mpasi zimumpila-mumpila: mvita ku mbazi na bunkuta ku nsye mitima. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Kansi Nzambi yikwe syamisanga bantu baa mu kati di lebakani, wutusyamisi mu nyizulu yi Tito, <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />ka nyizulu andi kaka ko yi tusyamisi, kansi mu nsyamusunu mpe yi katambula ku yeno. Wutuyadila mpolo bwedi ludidi na mpwila yiyingi mu nyena, manswela meno na vema kweno mu meeno. Mimvimba bemyomyo misidi ti kyese kyani kiba kikingi.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Ni hahoho, tala ti mukanda ani wuluyenisi kyadi, meno wunyongisi ko. Tala ti wunyongisi, mu dyambu nayeni ti mukanda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Taleeno kinotika ki mu 2 Ko 2.3 </char></note> bewuwu, wuluyenisi kyadi mwa ntangu yifyoti. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Kansi nina kiyangidika bwabu, ka mu dyambu di kyadi kyeno ko, kansi kyadi kyeno kisidi ti luvilula madyela. Mu dyambu ti kyadi ki luyeni kikitukidi kyese ha meso ma Nzambi. Ni mu ta ti, yeto tuluhidikidi misamu mimbi ko. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Mu dyambu ti, kyadi kikwe fumanga ku Nzambi, kikwe sanga ti muntu kavilula madyela makwe natanga ku mpulusu, wulembolo sa manyongo. Kansi kyadi kikwe fumanga mu nsatu zi nza, kikwe natanga ku lufwa. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Taleeno nkye ndandu kyadi bekyokyo, kikwe fumanga ku Nzambi, kibuta mu yeno: nkye manzaki, nkye ndombolo mulemvo, nkye mbisulu yi misamu mimbi, nkye bunkuta, nkye mpwila mu nyena dyaka, nkye vema, nkye manzaki mu semba mambi! Lutomini lonka ti mu mimvimba, luu na kibila mu musamu bewowo ko.<verse eid="2CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Tala ti nalusonikini bwabu, ka mu dyambu di muntu wuhidikidi misamu mimbi ko, hoti mu dyambu di yondowo wu bahidikidi misamu mimbi, kansi mu lonka ha ntadisi eno vema kweno mu yeto, mwanki kuyenika ha ntadisi yi Nzambi. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Musamu wawowo wu tusyamisi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Kansi tutambula kaka nsyamusunu ko, tutoma kiyangidika dyaka bubwingi mu yena kyese ki Tito mu dyambu ti yeno bamvimba lumubwisidi mutima. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Tala ti nakiyangidika mu yeno ha ntadisi andi, lunyenisi nsoni ko! Kansi bumosi mpe bu tukwe luteelanga kadi ntangu kikedika, bumosi mpe masiika ma tusidi mu yeno ha ntadisi yi Tito mayenikini makedika. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Ni hahoho, luzolo lwandi mu yeno luvudidi bunene, bu kakwe bambukanga moyo bwedi lumutumimini yeno bamvimba na bwedi lumubwanini mu kintekoto na bunkuta. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Nina kiyangidika, mu dyambu ti nsiidi kivuvu mu yeno mu mimvimba.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Lusadusu lu bisi-Masedwani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Zimpangi, tutiidi mu luzabikisa bwedi Nzambi kahaanini lusakumunu ku mabundu ma kizunga ki Masedwani. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Mpeleko baba mu ntontolo zimpasi zimumpila-mumpila, kansi baba bafuluka mu kyese kihyokidi kitezo, mpe mu buwelo bwawu bubwingi, bahaana bimvwama bihyokidi kitezo mu kyese. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Mbangi nidi ti, mu luzolo lwawu baheeni bonso buu lubaku lwawu na baheeni mpe kuhyoka lubaku lwawu, mu luzolo lu yawu bende <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />mpe batoma tubombidila tubahaana luve, mwanki yawu mpe baba kintwadi mu haana lusadusu ku bantu bavwihulu ku Nzambi. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Bahaana kuhyoka bi twedi kingila kuu yawu, mu dyambu ti bahaana ntete luzingu lwawu ku Mfumu, mboki batutumimina, bonso bu luzolo lu Nzambi. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Ni hahoho, tusyamisina Tito mu manisa kuu yeno, kisalu bekyokyo kye haana lusadusu, bonso bu katonina kyo. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Mu dyambu ti bafuluka ludi mu mimvimba: kiminu, kuzaba kuzonza, nzayilu, vema mu mimvimba na luzolo kuu yeto, seeno ti kitezo bekyokyo lulonka kyo mu kisalu kye haana lusadusu.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Ka ntumunu ko nina haana, kansi bu naluzonzidi vema di bahiika, ni mu luhaana hwahwa dye lonka ti luzolo lweno lukedika ludi. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Mu dyambu ti, luzebi bumbote bu Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto: yandi wuba mvwama, wukisa muntu wu muwelo mu dyambu dyeno, mwanki lukituka zimvwama mu buwelo bwandi.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Mabanza mani nina haana mu musamu bewuwu: bufweni ku yeno mu tatamana, mumvu wuhyokidi yeno luba bantete, ka mu sala kaka ko, kansi mu bonga dyaka nzengolo ye sala. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Bwabu, sukiseeno kisalu bekyokyo! Tomeeno kye sadila mu luzolo bonso bu lubongila kyo nzengolo mu sala, mwanki kidedakana bonso buu lubaku lweno. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Mu dyambu ti Nzambi kwe tambulanga munkayulu wuheeni muntu mu mutima wumbote, bonso budi lubaku lwandi, kansi ka lulembolo ba nandi ko.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Mu dyambu ti, ka tutidi mu lukotisa mu nkwamusu ko mu katula bahiika mu mpasi, kansi mu sosa kwandi ludedakana: <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />bwabu mu ntangu beyiyi bimvimba byeka neeno bibingi, bina luhaana hwahwa mu sadisa yobobo baa mu nsatu. Bumosi mpe, kilumbu ki lwaaba yeno mpe mu nsatu, yawu baaba na byo bibingi baalusadisa. Ni bwabobo lwaabeela badedakana, <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />bonso buwudi wusonama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 8:15">«Muntu bewowo wutoota bubwingi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 8:15">kahyokidila kima ko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 8:15">na muntu bewowo wuba na mwa ndambu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 8:15">kalembolo ba na kima ko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Taleeno mu Ndu 16.18</char></note>.»<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tito na nkayi zandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Bika tutonda Nzambi bu katuula mu mutima wu Tito vema kumosi mu dyambu dyeno. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Tito wutambula ndombolo eto, mpe bu kaba na vema kukwingi, ni kabonga yandi bende nzengolo mu kwiza ku yeno. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Tuna tambika ha kimosi nandi, mpangi yina kwe siiki mabundu mamvimba mu nsamununu andi yi Musamu Wumbote. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Bumosi mpe, bamusoola ku mabundu mu kwiza neto mu nzyetolo, mu kisalu bekiki kye luhaana lusadusu, kisalu bekiki ki tuna lungisa mu nkembo yi yandi bende Mfumu, mpe mu lonka kimbangi ki luzolo lweto lumbote.<verse eid="2CO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Tutiidi ko batuzonzila bumbi mu dyambu di mbongo zizingi zi tutambudila kizitu mu keba, <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />tuna sosa kwandi mu hidika misamu mimbote, ka ha ntadisi yi Mfumu kaka ko, kansi na yi bantu mpe.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Tuna tambika ha kimosi nawu mpangi eto. Ntangu zizingi tukwe bakanga hwahwa mu mutonta mpe yandi kwe toma lonkanga vema kwandi. Kansi bwabu, wuna vudila mu lonka dyaka vema kwandi mu dyambu di kivuvu kyandi kikingi mu yeno. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Mu dyambu ditadidi Tito, mukundi ani na mu naani mu kisalu mu Klisto ku yeno. Mu dyambu di zimpangi zihiika zina zyeta ha kimosi nawu, badi bantu ba batambikidi ku mabundu, mpe bana sala mu dyambu di nkembo mu Klisto. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Balonkiseeno bwabu ti lubatiidi bubwingi, mwanki mabundu ma kwikila na ma zaba ti tuu na luve mu kiyangidika mu dyambu dyeno.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Mimbutu mye haana minkayulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Bufwanakani ko ti, meno nalusonikina, mu dyambu di lusadusu lwe haana ku bantu bavwihulu ku Nzambi, ku kizunga ki Yuda. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Mu dyambu ti nzebi luzolo lweno lumbote, mpe na yangaladi mu dyambu dyeno ku bisi-Masedwani, bu nata ti: «Mpangi zi kizunga ki Akayi, zikubama zidi mu haana tuuka mvula yi hyokidi.» Mpe vema kweno kutukisi vema ku bantu babingi ha kati dyawu. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Buna nina lutambika zimpangi, mwanki masiika matusidi mu yeno malembolo ba ma mpamba, mpe mwanki luba bakubama, bonso bu nateedi. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Tala ti bisi-Masedwani bizidi ha kimosi naani, mpe bizi lubwana balembolo kubama, zaaba nsoni kuu yeto mu musamu bewuwu wumvimba. Ku yeno mpe zaaba nsoni. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Ni hahoho, nayenini ti musamu wumbote mu syamisa zimpangi zintekidila ku yeno tekila meno niiza, mu kubika minkayulu mi luhaanina nsilulu. Myaaba mikubama bonso lusakumunu lu makedika, kansi ka bonso dyambu dye kwikisa ko.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Zaabeeno ti: muntu wuna kuna mwa ndambu, mwa ndambu mpe kaayonzika, na muntu wuna kuna bubwingi, bubwingi mpe kaayonzika. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Bika kadi muntu kahaana bonso bukakeni mu mutima andi, wulembolo sa manyongo, na wulembolo kwikisa, mu dyambu ti Nzambi kwe tyanga muntu kwe haananga mu kyese. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Mpe Nzambi wuu na lulendo mu lufulusa mu lusakumunu lu mumpila-mumpila, mwanki mu ntangu zimvimba na mu mimvimba, lubaka bimvimba bii neeno nsatu. Mpe lubwesa baka bibingi bihyokidi mu bisalu bimbote bimumpila-mumpila. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Bonso bu wudi wusonama ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">«Kwe haananga mu luzolo ku miwelo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">bumbote bwandi buu na nsukunu ko.»<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Nzambi kwe haananga nswanga ku kikuni, na dimpa bonso bindya, waaluhaana na waafunisa nswanga yii neeno nsatu, mwanki bumbote bweno bubuta mimbutu mimingi. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Waalukitula zimvwama zizinene mu mimvimba, mwanki lulonka kadi ntangu luzolo lweno lwe kabula. Buna bantu babingi baatonda Nzambi mu minkayulu mi twaabahaana mu nkumbu eno. <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Mu dyambu ti, kisalu bekyokyo kye haana minkayulu, kikwe yukutisanga kaka zinsatu zi bantu bavwihulu ku Nzambi ko, kansi zikwe tukisanga dyaka zinsambulu zizingi zi mvutululu yi matondo kuu Nzambi. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Bantu bu baayena mfunu yi kisalu bekyokyo, baakembila Nzambi: mu dyambu di lutumumu lu luna lonka mu Musamu Wumbote wu Klisto na mu luzolo lweno lwe kabula ha kimosi nawu, mpe na bantu bamvimba. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Baalusambidila, mu lulonka luzolo lwawu, mu dyambu ti Nzambi wuheeni mulemvo wuhyokidi kitezo. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Tutondeeno Nzambi mu bumbote bwandi bungitukulu!<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Pawuli wuna nwanina kisalu kyandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Meno Pawuli nina lulomba mu malembe na mu bumbote bu Klisto, meno wu bakwe tanga ti, muntu wukuluka ti nii ha kati dyeno, kansi muntu wukibakala ti nii kitatu neeno. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Nina lubombidila, mu ntangu yi naakwiza ku yeno, lunsindisilandi mu zonzila mu kibakala bu naaba ha kati dyeno, mu dyambu ti mu kibakala naazonzila ku bantu bebobo bana banzila ti yeto mu kimuntu tuna kwe dyatidi. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Wukedika ti, bantu tudi, kansi tuna nwanina mu kimuntu ko. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Mu dyambu ti bilwazu bi tuna kwe sadidi mu nwana bii bilwazu bi kimuntu ko, kansi lulendo lwawu lukwe fumanga ku Nzambi. Bilwazu byo bikwe tusadisanga mu bedisa mabanza mambi <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />na bimvimba bikwe tediminanga mu mayama nzayilu yi Nzambi. Mpe tukwe tulanga mu boloko mabanza mamvimba mambi, mwanki matumimina Klisto. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Bakubama tudi mu semba bamvimba bakwe lembolo mye tumiminanga, mu ntangu yi twaayena ti luna toma tumimina mimvimba.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Fyongonineeno bonso buu misamu! Tala ti muntu kwikidi ti vwihulu ku Klisto, bika kafyongonina dyaka ebu: tala ti vwihulu ku Klisto, yeto mpe! <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Naayena nsoni ko, kati nina kiyangidika mu lulendo lutuhaana Mfumu, lulendo luna tuhaana luve mu tunga dibundu dyeno, kansi ka mu mwangisa dyo ko. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Mu mikanda myani, nina sosa mu luhaana bunkuta ko. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Mu dyambu ti, bana kwe tengi ti: «Mikanda mi Pawuli ngolo na nkasu midi, kansi bu kakwe banga neto kintwadi, muntu wulebakana kadi na mi kakwe zonzanga mii mfunu ko.» <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Bika yondowo kwe zonzilanga bobo katoma we zaba ti: bu tuu kitatu neeno, bonso bu tudi mu mpova zeto mu mikanda myeto, bwabobo mpe bwaaba mavanga meto bu twaaba neeno kintwadi.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Tuna sosa ko ti tudedakana hoti tufwanakana na bahiika bakwe kiyenikisanga yawu bende. Bakwe kibongilanga yawu bende bonso kitezo mu kifwanikisa na bahiika, baa na madyela ko. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Mu yeto, tutiidi mu kiyangidika kuhyoka kitezo kifwanakani ko, kansi mbo tusadila bo mu kitezo ki kisalu ki tukubikila Nzambi, mu tuhaana hwahwa dye tula natee kuu yeno. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Tuna hyoka ndilu eto ko, bonso ti yeto tutula natee kuu yeno ko, mu dyambu ti tutula natee kuu yeno mu lunatina Musamu Wumbote wu Klisto. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Buna tuna kiyangidika ko mu bisalu bi bantu bahiika baa ku mbazi yi ndilu eto. Kansi, tala ti kiminu kyeno kina kula, tuu na kivuvu mu yena ti kisalu kyeto kina kula ha kati dyeno, mu ndilu yi kisalu kyeto. <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />Buna tulendi mwangisa Musamu Wumbote mu bizunga bii kitatu neeno, wulembolo ku kiyangidika mu kisalu kisiidi bantu bahiika mu ndilu yi kisalu kyawu.<verse eid="2CO 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Wusonama ti: «Muntu tiidi mu kiyangidika, ka kiyangidika mu Mfumu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Taleeno mu </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:23">Yel 9.23</ref></char><char style="xt" closed="false" /></note>» <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Mu dyambu ti ka muntu bewowo kwe kiyenikisanga yandi bende ko bakwe yangidikanga, kansi ni muntu bewowo Mfumu wu kakwe siikanga.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s1">Pawuli na zintumwa ziluvunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Aa! Tala ti lulenda vibidila mwa ndambu yi bulahuki bwani! Ninga, mvibidileeno. <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Meno kimbanda kii naani mu yeno, kyokyo kifumini ku Nzambi. Mu dyambu ti, naluhaana nsilulu yi makwela ku bakala dimosi kaka, mu lulonka ku Klisto bonso ndumba yivedila yilembolo zaba bakala. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Kansi bunkuta bu naani ti madyela meno bakitula mo mambi, mpe maluzimbisa nzila yi luzolo na yi mvedosolo mu Klisto, bonso Eva wuhunuka ku nyoka mu madyela mandi ma luvunu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Taleeno mu<char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 3:1-6">Mba 3.1-6</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 3:13">13</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Mu dyambu ti, lukwe toma vibidilanga muntu wuntete wizidi mu lulonga Yesu diswaswana na Yesu di tululonga, hoti luna tambula Mpeve yiswaswana na yo yi lutambula, hoti lutambudi Musamu Wumbote wuswaswana na wo wulutambula.<verse eid="2CO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Meno mbanzidi ti nii kani wufyoti ko ha meso ma zintumwa zikwe kibanzilanga ti yawu bavudidi bunene. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Wukedika ti nii na ludede lwe zonzila bumbote ko, kansi nzayilu zii naani, mpe watutomini lulonka mu nzila zimvimba na mu misamu mimvimba.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Bwedi disumu nasidi bu nalusamunini Musamu Wumbote wu Nzambi wumpamba, bu nakikuludi mwanki baluzangula e? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Natambula mbongo zi Mabundu mahiika bonso mufutu ku yawu mu sala ha kati dyeno. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Mu ntangu yi naba ku yeno, nalomba nakani kima ku muntu ko, bu naba mu mbindumunu, mu dyambu ti zimpangi zifuma ku kizunga ki Masedwani, zintwadila bima biba naani mfunu. Mu mimvimba, natoma kikeba mu lembolo ba kizitu kuu yeno, mpe nina tatamana mu kikeba. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Mu kikedika ki Klisto kii mu meno, nina ta ti: kunaani muntu waankakidila mu zonzila musamu bewowo we kiyangidika mu kizunga kimvimba ki Akayi. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Mu dyambu di nki e? Mu dyambu ti nilutiidi ko e? Nzambi zebi ti nilutiidi.<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Kansi, nina tatamana mu sa misamu mi nakwe sanga, mu lembolo haana hwahwa ku yobobo bana sosa mu ba kidede neeto, mu misamu mi bana kwe kiyangidiki. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Mu dyambu ti, bantu bebobo zintumwa zi luvunu zidi, bisadi bi lembolo ba na makedika bikwe kitukanga zintumwa zi Klisto. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Mpe dii dyambu dye yituku ko, mu dyambu ti Satana yandi bende kwe kitukanga mbazi yi kukya. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Buna, dii dyambu dye yituku ko ti bisadi bebyobyo mpe bikituka bisadi bi lunungu. Nsukunu awu yaafwanakana na mavanga mawu.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpasi zi yena Pawuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Nina vutukila mu ta ti: nakani muntu kambongilandi bonso kilahuki ko. Ntambuleeno bwabu bonso muntu wulahukidi, mwanki meno mpe na kiyangidika mwa ndambu. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Dyambu di nina ta, nina dye teela bonso butiidi Mfumu ko, kansi bonso kilahuki, mpe nii na kivuvu ti, nina baka nzila mu kiyangidika. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Budidi ti bantu babingi bana kwe kiyangidikingi mu misamu mi kimuntu, meno mpe naakiyangidika. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Mu dyambu ti, yeno ludi bantu bandwenga, luna vibidila bantu baa bilahuki. <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Luna vibidila ti balukitula mindongo, balubonga bimvwama byeno, bavwamina mu nitu zeno, balusila munwa, na baluzuba ku kiini. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Nsoni nina yena mu ta wo: tubedi batoma lebakana mu musamu bewowo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Kansi, mimvimba mina sosa muntu mu sa - nina zonzila bonso muntu wulahukidi- meno mpe mya nina sosa mu sa! <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Ba-Ebeleo badi e? Meno mpe mu-Ebeleo nidi. Ba-Isaeli e? Meno mpe mu-Isaeli nidi. Mu nkuna yi Abalahami badi e? Meno mpe mu nkuna yi Abalahami nidi. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Bisadi bi Klisto bidi e? —Nina zonzila bonso muntu wulahukidi— Meno nabavudidi! Nabahyokidi mu sala bisalu bingolo, natuulu mu boloko nkumbu zizingi, bankata bubwingi, mpe nabwabana nsisi zizingi zi lufwa. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Nkumbu zitanu Bayudayo banzuba lutangu maku matatu na vwa lu bikoti, <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />nkumbu tatu bankata bikoti, nkumbu yimosi bawinda matadi, nkumbu tatu naba mu kati di masuwa madyama, nahyokisa kilumbu kimosi na mpimpa yimosi mu kati di mubu. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Mu nzyetolo zani zizingi, naba mu nsisi mu zinzadi, mu nsisi ha ntadisi yi binkita, mu nsisi ha ntadisi yi zimpangi zani batudi nsi yimosi, mu nsisi ha ntadisi yi balembolo ba Bayudayo, mu nsisi mu zimbanza, mu nsisi mu zinsi zinkatu, mu nsisi mu mubu, mu nsisi ha ntadisi yi zimpangi zimbi. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Nayena mpasi zi bisalu bingolo na nahonga, ntangu zizingi nabwa tolo ko, nafwa nsatu, nabaka mpwila yi mamba, namina nsoki, nakwamusu mu kyozi, mpe naba na binkutu ko. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Nina zonzila misamu misidi ko, kadi kilumbu nina kwamusu mu kizitu ki mayindu ma Mabundu mamvimba. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Nani wuu wulebakana wa sa ti meno nalembolo lebakana e? Nani wubwa mu masumu wa sa ti meno nalembolo yena mpasi ku nsye mutima e?<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Tala ti ndendi kiyangidika, naakiyangidika mu lebakani dyani! <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Nzambi wudi Tata di Mfumu Yesu, mpe wudi wusakumunu mimvu ka mimvu, zebi ti nina huna ko. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Bu naba ku mbanza yi Damasi, munyaadi wu ntinu Aletasi, wutuula minkengi ha myelo mi mbanza yi Damasi mu nkanga. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Kansi bandukisila ha nela ni bankulumunina mu kitunga ku mbazi yi kibaka. Bwabobo navuukila.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pawuli wuwoka </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ku mbanza Damasi </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 9:24-25">Mav 9.24-25</ref></char>. </note><verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Mbweno ziyena Pawuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Bwabu mfweti kiyangidika! Mpeleko buu mfunu ko, kansi mfweti luteela bwabu misamu mi nayena mu mbweno na Mfumu mi kanzabikisa mu Mpeve. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Nazebi muntu wumosi mu Klisto, zeka mvula kumi na ziya zihyoka, tuka bu bamunata natee ku mazulu mahyokidi ku zangama. (Nazebi ko hoti mu nitu andi, hoti ku mbazi yi nitu andi, kansi Nzambi zebi wo.) <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Mpe nazebi ti muntu bewowo - tala ti mu nitu andi hoti ku mbazi yi nitu andi, nazebi ko, kansi Nzambi zebi wo - <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />Nzambi wumutombola natee ku paladiso na wuyuwa mpova muntu zi kalendi lembolo bangula, mpe zilembolo haanunu luve ku muntu mu zonzila. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Naakiyangidika mu muntu wu bobobo, kansi mu mebende naakiyangidika ko, tala ti ka mu lebakani dyani ko. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Tala ti natya mu kiyangidika, nganunu naaba kilahuki ko, mu dyambu ti kikedika kwandi naaketi ta. Kansi nasa bo ko, mwanki nakani muntu kabanzila ti meno na hyokididi bahiika mu myo mi bakwe yenanga hoti mi bakwe yuwanga mu meno.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Ni hahoho, mwanki nalembolo ba na mayama mu misamu mi banzabikisa mu Mpeve, bantula mu nitu mpasi zingolo bonso mbazi yi Satana yi batuma mu ntuta mwanki nalembolo sa mayama. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Nkumbu zitatu nasambila mu bombidila Mfumu kantatudila mpasi bezozo, <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />na wumvutudila ti: «Mulemvo ani wufweni ku ngeye! Mu dyambu ti lulendo lwani lukwe lunganga mu lebakani.» Ntiidi bwabu mu kiyangidika mu lebakani dyani, mwanki lulendo lu Klisto luba mu kati dyani. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Ni hahoho, nakwe yangalalanga mu lebakani, mu bituku, mu mpasi, mu nkwamusu, mu mfyetokoso mu dyambu di Klisto, mu dyambu ti bu nii mu lebakani, ni bwabobo nakwe belanga na ngolo.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mayindu ma Pawuli mu ba-Kolinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Meno nzonzidi bonso muntu wulahukidi, mu dyambu ti yeno lunsindisila mu sa bobo. Nganunu yeno luketi nsiikisa. Mpeleko nii kwandi muntu wumpamba ko, kansi nii kani wufyoti ko ha meso ma zintumwa zikwe kibanzilanga ti yawu bavudidi bunene. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Bidimbu bi kisalu kyani ki kintumwa bihilama ha kati dyeno, bu navibidila zintontolo zimvimba, mu nzila yi bidimbu, yi bimangu mpe yi misamu mingitukulu. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Nki lulembolo baka bibaka Mabundu mahiika e? Bu nalembolo ba kizitu kuu yeno e? Buna ndemvokileeno mu musamu bewowo wumbi.<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Bwabu nkubamani mu kwiza ku yeno nkumbu yitatu, mpe naaba kizitu ku yeno ko. Yeno nina kwe sosi, kansi ka mvwilu eno ko. Mu dyambu ti, ka baala ko bakwe lundanga mvwilu yi bibuti byawu, kansi bibuti bikwe lundanga mvwilu yi baala bawu. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Mu myo mintadidi, naaba mu kyese kilunga mu haana mvwilu ani yimvimba yii naani, mu kihaana mvimba mebende mu dyambu dyeno. Bu nina lutya bubwingi, bwedi, yeno luna ntiila kwandi mu ndambu e?<verse eid="2CO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Mpeleko naba kizitu ku yeno ko, kansi bantu bahiika bedi tanga ti meno nsadulu yimbi yi naani, mpe nalubaka mu mutambu mu madyela mani. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Bwedi bima nalubonga mu nzila yi muntu mu bantu bebobo ba nalutambika e? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Nasyamisa Tito mu kwiza ku yeno, mpe ha kimosi nandi natambika mpangi eto. Bwedi Tito kima kalubindimina mu lomba e? Nganunu tudyatila ha kimosi mu mpeve yimosi ko na mu bitambi bimosi ko e?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Tuuka ntama, bwa lukwe banzilanga ti yeto tukwe sosanga mu kinungisa ha ntadisi eno. Kaani! Ha ntadisi yi Nzambi mu Klisto tuna zonzila mimvimba bemimi. Mpangi zani zizola, ni mu lusadisa mu ntungulu eno yi kiminu. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Mu dyambu ti, bunkuta buu naani, bu naatula, nalembolo lubwana bonso buntiidi ti lubeela, mpe yeno lulembolo nyena bonso bulutiidi ti nabeela. Bunkuta buu naani mu bwana ha kati dyeno mayuma na kimbanda, nganzi na kimpala, matoola na kufundasana ku luvunu, mayama na mvwanzi. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Bunkuta bu naani ti bu naatula, Nzambi ani kabwesa nyenisa nsoni mu dyambu dyeno, mpe nadila mu babingi batekidi sa masumu na balembolo vilula madyela, mu biika busafu, kindumba na misamu mi nsoni mi basadila.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Malongi mamanunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Yiyi ni nkumbu yitatu naakwiza ku yeno. Bonso bu wudi wusonama ti: «Kadi musamu waabaka nzengolo mu kimbangi ki bantu bole hoti batatu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Taleeno mu </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 16:15">Mis 16.15</ref></char>.</note>» <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Wanateka luteela mu nzyetolo ani yinzole, mpe nina vutukila wo dyaka. Bu nakidi kitatu neeno, ntiidi mu zonza ku bantu bebobo bateka hola masumu na ku bantu bamvimba ti: bu naakwiza dyaka, naafwila kani muntu kyadi ko. <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Yeno luna sosa kidimbu kina lonka ti Klisto kwe zonzanga mu meno. Mu dyambu ti, kaa wulebakana ku yeno ko, kansi kwe lonkisanga lulendo lwandi ha kati dyeno! <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Ninga, Klisto bamukoma ha kulunsi mu lebakani dyandi, kansi wumoyo kadi mu lulendo lu Nzambi. Mu kintwadi nandi, yeto mpe balebakana tudi mu yandi, kansi twaazinga ha kimosi nandi mu dyambu dyeno, mu lulendo belolo kwandi lu Nzambi.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Kifyongonineeno yebende mu zaba tala ti bakwikama ludi mu kiminu, tomeeno kitala yebende. Yeno luna zaba ko ti Yesu-Klisto wuu mu kati dyeno e? Buna lumana bwa kweno ha ntadisi yi ntontolo. <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Kansi kivuvu kii naani ti, yeno waluzebi ti yeto tubwa ha ntadisi yi ntontolo ko. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Tuna sambila Nzambi, mwanki lulembolo hidika misamu mimbi. Ka mu lonka ku bantu nungunu eto mu ntontolo ko, kansi mwanki yeno luhidika misamu mimbote, mpe yeto tuyenika bonso bantu babwa mu ntontolo. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Mu dyambu ti, tuu na lulendo lwe nwanisa kikedika ko, kansi lulendo luu neto mu sadila kaka kikedika. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Tuna kiyangidika ntangu zimvimba bu tudi balebakana, kansi yeno ngolo ludi. Mpe lusambulu lweto ludi ti yeno luba bantu balunga. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Ni hahoho nina sonikina bobo bu nii kitatu neeno, mwanki bu naaba neeno, nalembolo ba na nkasu, bonso buu lulendo lu mpaana Mfumu mu tunga, kansi ka mu mwangisa dibundu ko.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Zimpangi, mu manisa, yangalaleeno, beeno bantu balunga, syamasanangeeno yeno na yeno, wawasanangeeno, zingangeeno mu kiyenge. Mpe Nzambi yi luzolo na yi kiyenge yaaba neeno!<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Haanasanangeeno zimbote yeno na yeno bonso zimpangi zivwihulu ku Nzambi. Bantu bamvimba bavwihulu ku Nzambi mbote bana luhaana.<verse eid="2CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Bika lusakumunu lu Mfumu Yesu-Klisto, luzolo lu Nzambi, na kintwadi ki Mpeve Yilongo biba na yeno bamvimba!<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>